      "side": 1,
      "message": "I\u0027m wondering why exactly we need this hypercall which is basically useless.\n\nIf we just want to let the IOMMU driver keep calling iommu_disable_translation() even though it knows that it doesn\u0027t really work, can\u0027t we just return here without doing anything?\n\nPerhaps we may even consider making sure the IOMMU driver doesn\u0027t trigger iommu_disable_translation() with pKVM, and add a WARN_ON here in case it is still triggered...",
      "revId": "978040a1d6f04db1c84e3f7c53f3e5906d4ca138",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
